 "h": 684, "sh": 131949243, "N": 8857, "br": 7.723, "dbr": -0.159, "dh": -0.73}], "statements": {"n": 22, "from": "2021-07-28", "last": [{"d": "2026-07-29", "n": 3.21, "z": 2.8, "rz": -1.15, "earn": true, "q": "PTC delivered strong financial execution in Q3’26. Customers increasingly recognize the importance of our Intelligent Product Lifecycle vision. This coincides with the go-to-market and product strategy emphasis the company has undertaken over the past several quarters and results in a more durable business model that p…", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312526323617/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-06", "n": 1.6, "z": 0.38, "rz": -1.82, "earn": true, "q": "PTC delivered solid financial results in Q2’26. Our go-to-market transformation continues to gain traction and our Intelligent Product Lifecycle vision is resonating with customers. The execution and momentum we’ve established over the past several quarters give us confidence that we are building a more durable, multi-…", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312526208904/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-03-16", "n": 0.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We are pleased to complete the divestiture of our Kepware and ThingWorx businesses as we increase our focus on our Intelligent Product Lifecycle vision,", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312526107315/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-04", "n": 2.42, "z": 1.62, "rz": -0.42, "earn": true, "q": "PTC delivered solid financial results in Q1’26, driven by large deal volume and competitive displacements. The continued progress we’re making with our go-to-market transformation is resulting in strong and strategic demand capture. This gives us greater confidence that we are building a more durable, multi-year growth…", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312526037588/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-05", "n": 0.0, "z": -1.31, "rz": -3.76, "earn": true, "q": "Q4 capped a year of solid execution and focus. The divestiture of Kepware and ThingWorx will sharpen our portfolio around CAD, PLM, ALM, and SLM – the foundation of our Intelligent Product Lifecycle vision,", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312525266865/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}, {"d": "2025-07-30", "n": 0.34, "z": -1.34, "rz": -3.77, "earn": true, "q": "Q3 was another solid quarter of execution for PTC. Our strategy of enabling product data foundations and extending the value of that data across the enterprise is resonating with customers across our verticals and geographies,", "a": "said Neil Barua, President and CEO, PTC", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000095017025100205/ptc-ex99_1.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-07-29", "z": 2.8, "mood": "up"}, "say_do": {"mood": "up", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 54, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}, {"it": "27 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "27 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni